9 among likely voters.\n\nPrediction markets on Kalshi and Polymarket both price Ryan's chances at 94 to 95 percent. The race has drawn little national attention, and the most notable recent development is an ethics complaint regarding Ryan's Washington residence, which so far appears to have had limited effect. The fundamentals point to a comfortable but not automatic Ryan win.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.983, "margin": 17.1}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.971, "margin": 15.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.9767, "margin": 15.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.9844, "margin": 15.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.9723, "margin": 16.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.9684, "margin": 14.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.971, "margin": 14.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.978, "margin": 14.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.9814, "margin": 15.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.9828, "margin": 14.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.9869, "margin": 15.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.9867, "margin": 16.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.9709, "margin": 13.0}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.972, "margin": 15.0}]}